{
  "question": "How many written quotes does CUNY require for purchases between $20,000 and $50,000?",
  "status": "answered",
  "answer": "CUNY requires a minimum of three written quotes for purchases between $20,000 and $50,000. This rule is set forth in the CUNY Procurement Policy (2019). The policy states that for purchases of $20,000 or more but less than $50,000, Purchasing Departments must obtain a minimum of three written quotes from vendors.",
